[I] Dynamically managed firewall daemon with D-Bus interface

[T] firewalld provides a dynamically managed, stateful, zone based firewall
[T] with a D-Bus interface, allowing firewall rules to be changed at runtime
[T] without restarting the daemon or interrupting existing connections.

[U] https://github.com/firewalld/firewalld

[A] Thomas Woerner
